			<div class="content" id="post-content-4820065">
									

<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes or No</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> SCP-XXXX is one of three anomalous black stones.</p>
<p>1- Despite its diversified geological composition of multiple metamorphic rocks however it only possesses one color: black.</p>
<p>2- SCP-XXXX performs rolls for movement. It usually moves towards humans.</p>
<p>3- SCP-XXXX can relay information from &quot;Daddy&quot; (that we call SCP-XXXX-1). Empirical evidence of -1's were discovered after findings of black slanted metamorphic spikes underneath the earth after excavation.</p>
<p>3-SCP-XXXX can predict natural disasters 16 to 24 hours before the event by relaying communications from -1 to -2 (&quot;the Father&quot;). Afterwards, -2 causes the disaster.</p>
<p>5- SCP-XXXX goes into a tantrum after being ignored for a prolonged amount of time. This results in a natural disaster 16 to 24 hours because of anger from -1 and -2. Hence, it must be entertained by D-Class or researchers 16 hours a day.</p>
<p>6- SCP-XXXX has a voice of a male baby</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> In 2002, on a recon mission in Tibet, Jonathan Zhao (Zhao Jian-Nan) undercover SCP agent in the People's Army Police (PAP) secretly hid a strange stone in his backpack. When the stone was given to another SCP agent to be shipped to the U.S., the stone expressed separation anxiety. Zhao requested to go with it. Upon arrival in the U.S., Zhao did not express much affection towards it. He left D-Class personnel to play with it and did not care much about it. He went clubbing, drank a lot and he came back to the facility drunk. In 2005, he got married to a women he met at a club. His drunkenness also led him to come back to the facility one day and think that SCP-XXXX was the child he had with his women. Soon enough, he had this fatherly bond to it and had pictures of them hanging on the walls of his office space. They would dress up for Halloween, Thanksgiving and Christmas. He would divorce in 2007 because of fights with his wife about SCP-XXXX.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;View&nbsp;secret&nbsp;file</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Access&nbsp;confirmed</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Classified event- 2015</p>
<p>SCP-XXXX started crying for help and yelling about &quot;Daddy is going to kill again&quot;. Zhao tried to reassure him to no avail. SCP-XXXX's voice suddenly became deep and hoarse and said: &quot;Father, cleanse the 18.2208° North and 66.5901° West. It is so itchy.&quot; SCP-XXXX said &quot;See? Daddy is telling grandpa to kill again!&quot;</p>
<p>19 hours later, Puerto Rico (18.2208° N, 66.5901° W) was devastated by a hurricane.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> As insecticide is to bugs, disasters is to men. When will Daddy be angry and kill us all?</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> This work will be periodically worked on. Critiques at any stages will be useful :)</p>

