<p>SCP-XXXX changes color from Onyx Black (#0f0f0f) to Alizarin Crimson (#e32636) 1 month before natural disaster or pandemics. The total duration of the color change predicts the death tool of the disaster.</p>
</blockquote>
<p><em>But how would one even use such a warning? Is it about natural disasters within a certain set of parameters? Or within a certain geographic location?</em></p>
