<li>Honestly this does not seem like an anomaly the Foundation would designate as a numbered SCP. It sounds mildly anomalous. I think you need to <strong>flesh out</strong> the -1 entity, and how the Foundation could tell that this piece originates from an entity in the first place. How does the Foundation discover this rock?</li>
<li>Moreover, this is missing much in the way of stakes. This is a rock. It could be stored in a safe containment vault and forgotten about, it does not seem a threat to normalcy or indicative of this vast history you talk about in your &quot;Narrative&quot; section. You need to connect those dots</li>
